# INVOICE.DBF -- the accounts receivable ledger of the Initech Accounting
# System (Programming with InitechBase).  The due dates are stored as they
# were keyed on the data entry screen and converted with CTOD under the
# standard date convention (two-digit years, SET CENTURY OFF): a year keyed
# 00 is stored as 1900.  Same INVNO/AMOUNT/DUEDATE/PAID values as the
# ledger fixture of harness/diff/dbf_diff/mint_invoice_dbf.c.
TABLE INVOICE.DBF
FIELD INVNO C 5 0
FIELD CUST C 10 0
FIELD AMOUNT N 10 2
FIELD DUEDATE D 8 0
FIELD PAID L 1 0
REC A1001|HARTWELL|1250.00|19991215|F
REC A1002|BRAXTON CO|875.50|19000105|F
REC A1003|DELMAR INC|14400.00|19991130|T
REC A1004|QUINCY BK|99.99|19000210|F
INDEX INVNO.NDX INVNO
INDEX INVCUST.NDX CUST
